{title: Kaisa Ye Nasha Hai Tere Pyar Ka}
{artist: Shaan Vishal Shekhar}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Tera Musku [G] rana,        Phir [Em] Has Ke Paas [G] Aana
Mujhe [Am] Apnana Ba [G] tana,        Phir [Em] Pal Mein Gum Ho [G] Jana
Eh [Am] saas Hai,        [G] Abhi Us Pehli [Em] Baar [G] Ka
[Am] Kaisa Yeh,        [Em] Nasha Hai Tere [G] Pyaar Ka
[Am] Dil Se Dil [G] Mile The,        Jaise [Em] Do Phool [G] Khile The
Tab [Am] Maine Kuch [G] Kaha Tha,        Tum [Em] hare Hot [G] Sile The
Mujhe [Am] Yaad Hai Who,        [G] Lamha Inte [Em] zar Ka [G]
[Am] Kaisa Yeh [G] Nasha Hai,        Tere [Em] Pyaar Ka [G]
Chand [Am] Chehra Hai Tera,        [G] Raat [Em] Zulfein Hai Teri [G]
Yeh Ha [Am] wa Te [G] ri,        [Em] Khushboo [G] Hai
Yeh [Am] Samandar Ki Lehre,        [G] Tere [Em] Hasne Ki [G] Dhun Hai
Duni [Am] yan Yeh [G] Bas [Em] Tu [G] Hai,        Tu [Am] Paas Hai [G] To Saas Hai
Kha [Em] zana Hai Dil Ke Ka [G] rar Ka,        [Am] Kaisa Ye [Em] Nasha Hai Tere [G] Pyar Ka
Raat [Am] Thehri Hai Lekin,        [G] Teri [Em] Aankhon Ke [G] Aage
Bas Yeh [Am] Shaam,        [G] Si Lag [Em] ti [G] Hai
Din Su [Am] hana Agar Hai,        [G] To [Em] Tera Naam Leke [G]
Tere [Am] Pyaar [G] Se Fiza,        Me [Em] hekti [G] Hai
Aa [Am] ge Hashar Kya [G] Hoga Agar,        [Em] Asar Hai Yeh Ek Di [G] dar Ka
[Am] Kaisa Ye [Em] Nasha Hai Tere [G] Pyar Ka
